<title>NETHERLANDS: VNU NOT TO MAKE COUNTER OFFER FOR BLENHEIM.</title>
<headline>VNU NOT TO MAKE COUNTER OFFER FOR BLENHEIM.</headline>
<dateline>HAARLEM, Netherlands 1996-10-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher NV Verenigd Bezit VNU said on Tuesday it would not launch a counter bid for exhibitions organiser Blenheim Plc .</p>
<p>&quot;Given that United News and Media has since assured itself of more than half of the shares of Belnheim, VNU will not make a counter offer,&quot; VNU said in a statement.</p>
</text>
